WEBVTT

00:56:29.121 --> 00:56:33.996
that. Follow an incentive system of.

00:56:34.954 --> 00:56:37.496
What we want in our most
reflective best moments

00:56:37.663 --> 00:56:39.746
and are even better than what
we could think of ourselves

00:56:40.954 --> 00:56:46.538
is is it still the vision for open
eye that you will get to?

00:56:47.413 --> 00:56:50.413
Artificial general intelligence ahead of.

00:56:51.496 --> 00:56:56.204
The corporations, so that you can somehow
put a stake in the ground

00:56:56.204 --> 00:56:59.538
and build it the right way.

00:56:59.746 --> 00:57:02.579
Is that really a realistic
thing to to dream for?